;	This is a simple batch to sit and wait for the 1st FAX time then
;	try to send the FAX. It will call the AutoFAX.gpf ARexx script 
;	EVERY DAY at the time you specify in the WAIT command listed bellow.
;	AutoFAX.gpf will figure out if it is the correct day and time to 
;	send a FAX or not. So don't worry about it.
;
;	In your startup-sequence (or user-startup, or BBS-Startup) add this...
;
;		RunBack Execute Doors:FAX-IT/TryFAX

Wait 60

RunBack RX Doors:Fax-IT/AutoFAX.gpf

Wait Until 08:00
RunBack Doors:Fax-IT/TryFAX
